---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Builder. Mother. Wanderer." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				I'm Ingrid. I build things — products, companies, communities. I'm a product manager by trade,
				consultant by choice, and builder by compulsion. Right now I run
				<a href="https://artemisnova.com">Artemis Nova</a>, a PM consulting practice,
				and I'm building consumer apps through HighVibe Studio.
			</p>
			<p>
				I'm also a mom. My son Griffin was born in 2024 and rearranged everything —
				priorities, schedule, what I'm willing to trade my time for. Most of what I build now
				is in service of freedom: more time, more control, less permission-asking.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is where I write. No theme, no niche. Product thinking, parenthood,
				things I'm making, things I'm figuring out. If you want the polished version,
				check my LinkedIn. This is the real one.
			</p>
			<div class="links">
				<a href="https://x.com/ihartemis" target="_blank">X</a>
				<span class="sep">/</span>
				<a href="https://artemisnova.com" target="_blank">Artemis Nova</a>
				<span class="sep">/</span>
				<a href="/blog">Blog</a>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		max-width: 65ch;
	}
	h1 {
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
		color: var(--text-bright);
	}
	p {
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text);
	}
	.links {
		margin-top: 2em;
		padding-top: 2em;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(180,120,50,0.12);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 14px;
	}
	.links a {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	.links a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-hover);
	}
	.sep {
		color: #4a3e30;
		margin: 0 0.5em;
	}
</style>
